From: CervantesHallo <227578309+CervantesHallo@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [porting] winmm: Stage endpoint metadata before callbacks and worker startup.

Cider-Topic: audio/winmm
Base: wine-mirror/wine 7b3fff76fa5178f6ce0141b2c776afa2a822f101.
Status: candidate source port, not selected by a recipe or runtime-accepted.
Preserve new-base format mapping/masks and enumerator lifetime. Rebase old
Cider 0008 metadata cleanup/publication and 0014 startup ordering; explicit
shared-format probing policy remains a separate unresolved porting topic.

